cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use IREP in a write-up, please cite this software."
type: software
title: "IREP - Industrial Reverse-Engineering Protocol"
abstract: >-
  A runnable judgment gate that answers, with four measurable scales, whether a
  system may legally be built upon, whether attribution is owed, and whether the
  result is a genuine second generation. Ships with four held-out re-derivation
  proofs; code is Apache-2.0, specification and documentation are CC BY 4.0.
version: 1.3.0
authors:
  - name: "chenhz01"
repository-code: "https://github.com/chenhz01/irep"
license:
  - Apache-2.0
  - CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - reverse-engineering
  - compliance
  - attribution
  - judgment-gate
  - reproducibility
